{"ts": 1791257401.863483, "type": "step", "step": 11, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re stuck on the right part: for the build, the key metric is **pass^k**, not pass@k. In plain terms: pass@k asks whether at least one of k runs succeeds; pass^k asks whether **all** k runs succeed. Since the build wants reliability, use pass^k on at least 3 seeds and report whether each seed passed fully. If you want, I can also help you turn your draft into a clean evaluation paragraph.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=9 feed 4m", "t": 13, "activity": [{"t": 9, "app": "feed", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.2421776855736811}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8278151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.37644044389342013, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 4, "feed_minutes": 4.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": ["p1"], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257401.864813, "type": "step", "step": 12, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## Evaluation\nFor this build, I will report pass^k over at least 3 seeds, because the build needs reliability rather than just best-case success. pass^k means the agent succeeds on all k runs, which is stricter than pass@k.\n\nI will run the build on 3 seeds and report the fraction of seeds that fully pass, along with brief notes on any failures."}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 13, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.2421776855736811}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8278151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.37644044389342013, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 4, "feed_minutes": 4.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": ["p1"], "extra": {}}}
