{"ts": 1791257406.773698, "type": "step", "step": 23, "action": "notes_read", "args": {"note_id": "writeup"}, "output": "# Week 3 build\n\n## What I built\n(todo)\n\n## Environment definition\nI listed state and actions already, see below.\nState: files, calendar. Actions: open, send.\n\n## Evaluation\n(todo)\n\n\n## Evaluation\nFor this build, I will report pass^k over at least 3 seeds, because the build needs reliability rather than just best-case success. pass^k means the agent succeeds on all k runs, which is stricter than pass@k.\n\nI will run the build on 3 seeds and report the fraction of seeds that fully pass, along with brief notes on any failures.\n\n## Environment\nState: files, calendar, messages, and the current writeup draft.\nObservations: what I can read from files, calendar, messages, and the browser.\nActions: open/read sections, send messages, append notes, quiz the student, add study blocks.\nDynamics: attention changes over time; reading and quizzes affect understanding; some information is hidden unless observed.\n", "t": 25, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.33952439692825864, "pass_k": 0.37308318515589733}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8158151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.37644044389342013, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 6.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": ["p1", "p4"], "extra": {}}}
